      <Parameter Name="Text" Value="Start Feed Position&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;This functional block manages the reactor position order,&#xD;&#xA;which determines the sequence in which the feeds are started.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;We request an update of the &quot;Reactor To Start Feed&quot; position in&#xD;&#xA;the following two cases:&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;- In the logic that controls the start of the Emergency Recipe&#xD;&#xA;Sequence.&#xD;&#xA;- In the update performed after the start of each feed." />
